    "_recipe": "The Concord's recipe, version 6 (owner, 2026-11-06, with reference sheets: \"hull plating, clean hull\", \"notice large panels, and sub panels, liveries, varying colors of armor\", \"a clean off white ship, ideal for concord style\", \"vents, lights, escape hatches, missile tubes, bombe tobes\", \"warning markings too\", \"tiny holes or slots for rivets and bolts\"): large panels between the structure's stations, split into sub panels standing at their own heights, chamfered so every edge catches the light; off-white plates in several tones; the detail kit (hatches, vents, lit slots, thruster quads, accent modules, missile and bomb tubes) over the plating, mirrored; ordered machinery in the opened bays; rivet rows and painted warning marks; the render light with grime in the cavities.",
